# Go conventions

See [docs/ARCHITECTURE.md](docs/ARCHITECTURE.md) for full detail.

## Package

- Single root package `timeseries`
- Module: `github.com/eduard-kolotushin/timeseries`
- Go 1.26+

## API

- Methods on `Series[T]` for structural operations
- Package functions for `Series[float64]` numeric operations
- Return new series from public ops; clone slices as needed

## Quality

- Table-driven tests next to code
- No drive-by refactors outside the task
- Keep public API documented and stable within v1
- Hot paths: share `times` when only values change; pre-size; never mutate backing arrays in place
